# FINAL PRACTICAL EXAM CHECKLIST

Before completing each experiment, check:

- [ ] All required devices are added.
- [ ] All cables are connected to the correct ports.
- [ ] IP addresses and subnet masks are correct.
- [ ] Default gateways are configured correctly.
- [ ] Router interfaces are enabled using `no shutdown`.
- [ ] Routing, DNS, DHCP or VLAN configuration is completed as required.
- [ ] Verification commands are executed.
- [ ] Ping tests give the expected results.
- [ ] Configuration is saved.
- [ ] Screenshots of the topology, configurations and successful tests are captured.

**Tip:** Always check the interface names available on your Packet Tracer router before entering commands. Some router models use FastEthernet interfaces, while others use GigabitEthernet interfaces. Serial interface names and available ports may also differ depending on the model and installed modules.
